(self.webpackChunksite=self.webpackChunksite||[]).push([[631],{2193:e=>{"use strict";e.exports=JSON.parse('{"slug":"cosmic-hopper","title":"Cosmic Hopper","authors":[{"name":"Bernardo Wilchen de Oliveira","contact":"BerriesWithOnions","contactType":"github","contactUrl":"https://github.com/BerriesWithOnions"}],"date":1783814400000,"readme":"<p>Zorp, a little alien, fell out of his UFO and landed in the middle of a cosmic highway. Guide him across a lane of speeding spaceships and a river of stardust to reach the rescue landing pads on the other side \u2014 before his lives run out! Watch out not to fall into the void of space, or worse, getting run over by a space vehicle!</p>\\n<h2>How to play</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Use <strong>\u2b05 \u27a1 \u2b06 \u2b07</strong> to hop Zorp one tile at a time.</li>\\n<li>Avoid the spaceships crossing the highway.</li>\\n<li>Ride the drifting asteroid platforms to cross the stardust river \u2014 don\'t fall into the void between them!</li>\\n<li>Guide Zorp into each of the 4 empty landing pads to fill them all and clear the stage.</li>\\n<li>Clearing a stage grants a bonus life and raises the difficulty for the next one.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Stages</h2>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Stage 1</strong> \u2014 slow traffic and wide, forgiving platforms. A gentle warm-up.</li>\\n<li><strong>Stage 2</strong> \u2014 normal speed and spacing.</li>\\n<li><strong>Stage 3</strong> \u2014 fast lanes and narrow platforms. Only a steady hand gets Zorp home!</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>Clear all 3 stages to send Zorp back to his UFO and win the game.</p>\\n<h2>Credits</h2>\\n<p>Built with the WASM-4 fantasy console. Inspired by classic lane-crossing arcade games, reimagined with a cosmic alien theme.</p>"}')}}]);